					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I just took another look at the rubber duck one that was recently added. What time zone is it referring to? Noon and one PM where? Time is different in different zones, so it would make sense to give a time zone. I'm not comfortable changing it without the author's permission, and I'd like it if the original author resolved this issue, but anyone is welcome to.</p> <p>Also,</p> <blockquote> <p>This duck doesn't need anything to live&#8230;</p> </blockquote> <p>is very vague, but that's not too much of a problem as it's easily understandable.</p> <p>Edit: I guess there won't be a response to this. I'll leave it here anyways.</p> 
